<title>ETHIOPIA: Two die from injuries after Comoro crash.</title>
<headline>Two die from injuries after Comoro crash.</headline>
<dateline>ADDIS ABABA 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two people who survived the crash of a hijacked Ethiopian Airlines plane into the sea off the Comoro Islands have died of their injuries, airline officials in the Ethiopian capital said on Monday.</p>
<p>They said this took the presumed death toll from the crash of the Boeing 767 to 125. Fifty people, out of a total 175. are now believed to have survived when the plane ran out of fuel and ditched into the Indian Ocean on Saturday.</p>
</text>
